# ── Remark 1: Empty Classroom ───────────────────────────────────────────────
label yvara_s5_remark_1:
    narrator "You notice it on the way in. A classroom on the second floor sits dark and empty."
    narrator "Chairs stacked against the wall. No chalk dust on the board. The room smells of disuse."
