        narrator "You grip her hip with one hand. The other finds her shoulder, pulling her back onto you."
        narrator "Her composure holds for ten seconds. Twenty. Then it cracks."
        narrator "A moan she did not intend. Her hips pushing back to meet you. Her knuckles white against the bookshelf."
